algorithms.pseudocode:
function EVAL(v, f):
    if f is atom(n):      return v[n]              # default ff if absent
    if f is neg(p):       return NEG(EVAL(v, p))
    if f is conj(p, q):   return MIN(EVAL(v, p), EVAL(v, q))
    if f is disj(p, q):   return MAX(EVAL(v, p), EVAL(v, q))

NEG: ff->tt, bb->bb, tt->ff
MIN/MAX taken on the order ff < bb < tt

